<h1>5 Position Battles Decided by <em>Pure Athleticism</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 8 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>📊 Training Camp 2026</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">Most camp battles come down to scheme fit, chemistry, and coach preference. These five are different — they're built around speed, burst, and explosiveness, and the most athletic player is likely to win the job. Here's who has the edge and why.</p>
</div><div class="content">
